      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "forEach calls the function for each of the items in the array,\n always passing the individual item as an argument.",
      "fontSize": 17.372837015233177,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "forEach calls the function for each of the items in the array,\n always passing the individual item as an argument.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "BrxXwZmKsUx0pfes6C4ol",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 704.8260702096215,
      "y": -1568.4780928769208,
      "width": 668.3653072895762,
      "height": 62.6592475583977,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1977092598,
      "version": 91,
      "versionNonce": 1650135745,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793701689787,
      "created": 1793186375120,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One characteristic of the functional programming paradigm is the use of immutable data\nstructures. In React code, it is preferable to use the method concat, which creates a new\narray with the added item. This ensures the original array remains unchanged.",
      "fontSize": 16.709132682239407,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "One characteristic of the functional programming paradigm is the use of immutable data structures. In React code, it is preferable to use the method concat, which creates a new array with the added item. This ensures the original array remains unchanged.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
